<title>UK: CIBC sets $250 mln step-up 15-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CIBC sets $250 mln step-up 15-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following subordinated step-up floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIBC WOOD GUNDY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *14.AUG.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+35 BP    PAY DATE    14.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.85     FULL FEES   45 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.85</p>
<p>NOTES  *CALL ON 14.AUG.07 AT PAR AND EVERY PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p>THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	  **STEPS UP ON CALL DATE TO 3ML+135 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
